<BaseLayout title="Trevor Price School of Motoring - Lessons" description="Driving lessons covering all DVSA requirements, tailored to your needs at a pace to suit you.">
    <h1>Lessons</h1>
    <p>Lessons will cover all of the requirements specified by the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/driver-and-vehicle-standards-agency">Driver and Vehicle Standard Agency</a>, including:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Basic control of the vehicle</li>
        <li>Pace to suit you</li>
        <li>Manoeuvres</li>
        <li>Roundabouts</li>
        <li>Basic car maintenance (show me, tell me)</li>
        <li>Help and advice with theory and hazard perception test</li>
        <li>Night and wet weather driving</li>
        <li>Mock tests leading up to the day of your practical test</li>
        <li>Option to complete the Pass Plus after passing your practical test</li>
    </ul>
    <p>All lessons are tailored for your needs at a pace to suit you.</p>
    <p>Refresher courses are available for qualified drivers who have no recent experience.</p>
</BaseLayout>
